<view class="login-page screen-{{screen}}" style="--org-color:{{organizationColor}}">
  <view class="brand-row"><view class="brand-mark">班</view><view><text class="brand-name">班达</text><text class="brand-desc">让班级协作更简单</text></view></view>
  <view class="choice-view" wx:if="{{screen === 'choice'}}">
    <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">欢迎使用</text><text class="hero-title">选择适合你的使用方式</text><text class="hero-desc">之后仍可以退出登录并切换模式。</text></view>
    <view class="mode-card personal" data-mode="toc" bindtap="chooseMode" hover-class="mode-pressed"><view class="mode-icon">个</view><view class="mode-copy"><view><text>个人免费使用</text><label>ToC</label></view><text>无需手机号、微信资料、服务器或密码，输入本机显示名称即可开始。</text><view class="mode-features"><text>局域网连接</text><text>仅本机保存</text><text>无需授权</text></view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
    <view class="mode-card organization" data-mode="tob" bindtap="chooseMode" hover-class="mode-pressed"><view class="mode-icon">组</view><view class="mode-copy"><view><text>组织团队使用</text><label>ToB</label></view><text>连接组织部署的云服务，跨网络同步教室与教学数据。</text><view class="mode-features"><text>统一账号</text><text>组织管理</text><text>云端同步</text></view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="form-view" wx:elif="{{screen === 'personal'}}">
    <view class="back" bindtap="backToChoice" hover-class="back-pressed" aria-label="返回">‹</view><view class="form-hero personal"><view class="large-icon">个</view><text class="eyebrow">个人免费版</text><text class="form-title">设置本机显示名称</text><text class="form-desc">不注册账号，也不会读取你的手机号、微信头像或微信昵称。</text></view>
    <view class="form-card"><text class="label">显示名称</text><input class="field" type="text" maxlength="20" value="{{localName}}" bindinput="onLocalNameInput" placeholder="例如：刘老师" confirm-type="done" bindconfirm="enterPersonal"/><text class="field-note" style="display:block;margin:12rpx 4rpx 0;color:#8a919d;font-size:20rpx;line-height:1.55">仅用于在教室端识别你的身份，保存在当前设备。</text><button class="primary personal-button" bindtap="enterPersonal">开始使用</button></view>
    <view class="safe-note"><text>✓</text><view><strong>无需微信资料授权</strong><small>个人模式不收集手机号等个人信息；退出登录或清除微信数据会删除本地资料。</small></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="form-view" wx:elif="{{screen === 'organization'}}">
    <view class="back" bindtap="backToChoice" hover-class="back-pressed" aria-label="返回">‹</view><view class="form-hero organization"><view class="large-icon">组</view><text class="eyebrow">组织团队版</text><text class="form-title">登录你的组织</text><text class="form-desc">账号和初始密码由组织管理员统一发放。</text></view>
    <view class="form-card"><text class="label">服务器地址</text><input class="field" value="{{cloudServerUrl}}" bindinput="onCloudServerInput" placeholder="cloud.example.com:8080"/><label style="display:flex;align-items:center;margin:18rpx 0 4rpx;color:#4b5563;font-size:23rpx"><checkbox value="https" checked="{{cloudUseHttps}}" color="#2563eb" bindchange="onCloudHttpsChange"/><text style="margin-left:8rpx">使用 HTTPS 安全连接</text></label><text style="display:block;margin:0 0 18rpx 52rpx;color:#8a919d;font-size:20rpx;line-height:1.5">关闭后将使用 HTTP，适用于局域网或已确认安全的服务。</text><text class="label">组织账号</text><input class="field" maxlength="80" value="{{cloudLoginName}}" bindinput="onCloudLoginNameInput" placeholder="请输入管理员发放的账号"/><text class="label">登录密码</text><input class="field" password maxlength="200" value="{{cloudPassword}}" bindinput="onCloudPasswordInput" placeholder="首次登录请使用默认密码"/><button class="primary organization-button" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="loginOrganization">登录组织</button></view>
    <view class="safe-note blue"><text>盾</text><view><strong>使用组织发放的账号</strong><small>登录过程不读取微信手机号、头像或昵称；首次登录后需要修改默认密码。</small></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="form-view" wx:else>
    <view class="organization-banner"><image wx:if="{{profileAvatar}}" src="{{profileAvatar}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view wx:else>{{organizationMark}}</view><text>{{organizationName}}</text><label>首次登录</label></view>
    <view class="form-hero compact"><text class="eyebrow">完成安全设置</text><text class="form-title">完善你的个人资料</text><text class="form-desc">为了账号安全，请先更换组织发放的默认密码。</text></view>
    <view class="form-card"><text class="label">用户名</text><input class="field" type="text" maxlength="40" value="{{profileNickname}}" bindinput="onProfileNicknameInput" placeholder="用于组织内身份识别和页面展示"/><text class="field-note" style="display:block;margin:12rpx 4rpx 0;color:#8a919d;font-size:20rpx;line-height:1.55">此处不会读取微信昵称。进入主页后可在“我的”中主动设置头像。</text><text class="label">设置新密码</text><input class="field" password maxlength="200" value="{{profilePassword}}" bindinput="onProfilePasswordInput" placeholder="至少 10 位，请勿沿用默认密码"/><text class="label">确认新密码</text><input class="field" password maxlength="200" value="{{profileConfirmPassword}}" bindinput="onProfileConfirmInput" placeholder="再次输入新密码"/><button class="primary organization-button" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="completeProfile">保存并进入组织</button></view>
  </view>
</view>
